@api = https://localhost:7119

### 1. Create a redemption (2 x 500 + 1 x 1000 = 2000 points)
# @name create
POST {{api}}/redemptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-100", "lines": [ { "rewardSku": "CAP-01", "quantity": 2 }, { "rewardSku": "BOTTLE-01", "quantity": 1 } ] }

###
@id = {{create.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Delivery pending -> points reserved locally
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Pending" }

### 3. Reserved points should be 2000
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/reserved-points

### 4. Same status again -> IgnoredDuplicate
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Pending" }

### 5. Delivery held -> deduction requested
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Held" }

### 6. Provider confirms deduction -> reservation settled
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/points-committed

### 7. Reserved points should be 0 now
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/reserved-points

### 8. On delivery
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OnDelivery" }

### 9. Partial delivery: the bottle was not delivered -> reverse 1000 points
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CompletedPartially", "delivered": [ { "rewardSku": "CAP-01", "deliveredQuantity": 2 }, { "rewardSku": "BOTTLE-01", "deliveredQuantity": 0 } ] }

### 10. Provider confirms reversal -> PartiallyCompleted
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/reversal-confirmed

### 11. Full state with history
GET {{api}}/redemptions/{{id}}

### 12. Invalid transition -> 409 Conflict
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Pending" }